; Rabbit — model scene for AnimalDefinition.model_scenes
; Source: "Rabbit" by Sherkiz, via Poly Pizza. CC BY 3.0 — ATTRIBUTION IS REQUIRED.
;   https://poly.pizza/m/Km89u3twcR
; See project/attribution/sources/sherkiz_rabbit.tres for the required credit line.
;
; Wrapper carries the world-scale factor and the material overrides so the imported
; .glb stays byte-identical to the upstream download (which keeps the CC BY
; "indicate if you modified" question simple: the asset itself is unmodified).
;
; Material overrides exist for ONE reason: the source ships metallicFactor 0.4 on all
; three materials, which puts a metallic sheen on fur. Albedo and roughness are copied
; from the import unchanged; only `metallic` differs (0.4 -> 0.0).
;
; Y offset (2026-08-25): unlike the Quaternius/Mixamo animals, this asset's rig origin
; sits mid-body, not at the feet — measured combined mesh AABB at scale 0.72 puts the
; feet at y = -0.738 against a total height of 2.233 (~33% of the model buried).
; simulation/habitat_simulation.gd places residents at world y = 0.0 with no per-species
; ground offset, so residents were rendering sunk into the terrain. Model's transform
; origin.y = 0.73787242174149 lifts the feet back to y = 0 exactly (verified via a
; one-off headless AABB probe against Rabbit.tscn).
